  "Tuesday, February 2, 2016. Six am in the Hearthside Hotel. Three bright radio notes. A delivery van backfires twice.",
  "You are at the hotel lobby. A copy of a received telegram is at your hand: Alma's daughter in Pittsburgh has the whole interview. Her reply is 'I know that voice. Play it again.'"
 ],
